    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the haunting world of <i>Legend of Krigz</i>, a gripping horror survival experience set in a desolate, abandoned suburban town. You play as a specialist investigating the disappearance of an exploration team that ventured too far into a place they shouldn\u2019t have. A government experiment gone wrong has unleashed a terror unlike any other\u2014a monstrous, electricity-feeding predator known as <strong>Krigz</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay in the light or risk becoming the next victim. With limited resources, an adaptive enemy, and an environment where every flickering light could be a warning, survival is not guaranteed. Choose your approach: gather resources and set traps, or stay in the shadows and outmaneuver Krigz before it finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Watch your stats</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/dd8b562fc8ceddbd0ec8681ffb70254b.poster.avif?t=1746403704\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/dd8b562fc8ceddbd0ec8681ffb70254b.webm?t=1746403704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/dd8b562fc8ceddbd0ec8681ffb70254b.mp4?t=1746403704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cook your food</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/073966456b029068a3d3a435db8e252b.poster.avif?t=1746403704\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/073966456b029068a3d3a435db8e252b.webm?t=1746403704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Make your Traps</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/a0a74f5e2ce7203cdeb5a70e10ccda40.poster.avif?t=1746403704\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/a0a74f5e2ce7203cdeb5a70e10ccda40.webm?t=1746403704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/a0a74f5e2ce7203cdeb5a70e10ccda40.mp4?t=1746403704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic AI Creature</strong> \u2013 Krigz learns from your actions, adapting to your strategies and forcing you to constantly evolve your tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day/Night Cycle</strong> \u2013 Use the daylight to prepare, but once night falls, Krigz emerges to hunt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management &amp; Exploration</strong> \u2013 Scavenge for supplies, medkits and trap parts to increase your chances of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-Based Threat Detection</strong> \u2013 Krigz feeds off electrical sources, making powered locations dangerous. Turning on lights may help you see, but it will also make you easier to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Your choices shape the outcome. Will you escape, defeat the creature, or uncover a deeper mystery?</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the haunting world of <i>Legend of Krigz</i>, a gripping horror survival experience set in a desolate, abandoned suburban town. You play as a specialist investigating the disappearance of an exploration team that ventured too far into a place they shouldn\u2019t have. A government experiment gone wrong has unleashed a terror unlike any other\u2014a monstrous, electricity-feeding predator known as <strong>Krigz</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay in the light or risk becoming the next victim. With limited resources, an adaptive enemy, and an environment where every flickering light could be a warning, survival is not guaranteed. Choose your approach: gather resources and set traps, or stay in the shadows and outmaneuver Krigz before it finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Watch your stats</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/dd8b562fc8ceddbd0ec8681ffb70254b.poster.avif?t=1746403704\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/dd8b562fc8ceddbd0ec8681ffb70254b.webm?t=1746403704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/dd8b562fc8ceddbd0ec8681ffb70254b.mp4?t=1746403704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cook your food</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/073966456b029068a3d3a435db8e252b.poster.avif?t=1746403704\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/073966456b029068a3d3a435db8e252b.webm?t=1746403704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Make your Traps</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/a0a74f5e2ce7203cdeb5a70e10ccda40.poster.avif?t=1746403704\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/a0a74f5e2ce7203cdeb5a70e10ccda40.webm?t=1746403704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/a0a74f5e2ce7203cdeb5a70e10ccda40.mp4?t=1746403704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic AI Creature</strong> \u2013 Krigz learns from your actions, adapting to your strategies and forcing you to constantly evolve your tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day/Night Cycle</strong> \u2013 Use the daylight to prepare, but once night falls, Krigz emerges to hunt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management &amp; Exploration</strong> \u2013 Scavenge for supplies, medkits and trap parts to increase your chances of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-Based Threat Detection</strong> \u2013 Krigz feeds off electrical sources, making powered locations dangerous. Turning on lights may help you see, but it will also make you easier to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Your choices shape the outcome. Will you escape, defeat the creature, or uncover a deeper mystery?</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A terrifying horror survival game where you must outwit a deadly, electricity-hungry predator in an abandoned suburban town. Gather resources, set traps, and survive the night alone or in co-op. Every decision matters\u2014will you escape, fight, or become the hunted?",
